{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>\n\n</p>\n<p>其中一款以《拓麻歌子》產品為基礎，用户可以在其中培育數碼寶貝；另一款則採用《數碼寶貝》產品，讓用户培育拓麻歌子。</p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"《拓麻歌子》與《數碼寶貝》推出30周年互換養成玩具\" src=\"https://img.3dmgame.com/uploads/images/news/20261123/1795404872_205876.jpg\"/>\n</p>\n<p>此次聯動並非只在產品外觀上使用對方元素，而是直接交換兩套電子寵物體系的養成對象。</p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"《拓麻歌子》與《數碼寶貝》推出30周年互換養成玩具\" src=\"https://img.3dmgame.com/uploads/images/news/20261123/1795404876_651753.jpg\"/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"《拓麻歌子》與《數碼寶貝》推出30周年互換養成玩具\" src=\"https://img.3dmgame.com/uploads/images/news/20261123/1795404867_310373_jpg_r.jpg\"/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"《拓麻歌子》與《數碼寶貝》推出30周年互換養成玩具\" src=\"https://img.3dmgame.com/uploads/images/news/20261123/1795404872_205876.jpg\"/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"《拓麻歌子》與《數碼寶貝》推出30周年互換養成玩具\" src=\"https://img.3dmgame.com/uploads/images/news/20261123/1795404876_651753.jpg\"/>\n</p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-23T07:11:43.913318+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":97,"images":5,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-23T07:01:46+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-23T12:37:15.639947+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-23T07:05:12.764784+00:00","content_hash":"18c60b2fe41d209c0d283ff79fe269230fb47ec92429142f7dce2dfd24c16b02","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}